{
  "info": {
    "name": "Billo Commerce API",
    "description": "Coleccion de la API de Billo Commerce (Laravel + Sanctum, auth por cookie/sesion + CSRF, no Bearer token). Flujo obligatorio: 1) Auth > Get CSRF Cookie (siempre primero, en cada sesion de Postman), 2) Auth > Login, 3) Products > Create Product (guarda product_id), 4) Customers > Create Customer (guarda customer_id), 5) Orders > Create Order (usa product_id/customer_id, guarda order_id), 6) Orders > Update Order Status.\n\nLa coleccion maneja el header X-XSRF-TOKEN automaticamente (script a nivel de coleccion, lee la cookie XSRF-TOKEN que deja 'Get CSRF Cookie'). Postman guarda las cookies de sesion solas, no hace falta configurar nada mas.\n\nCambia la variable de coleccion `base_url`/`app_url` si no corres el servidor en localhost:8000.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Sanctum SPA auth: toda request que cambia estado necesita el",
          "// header X-XSRF-TOKEN con el valor de la cookie XSRF-TOKEN (que",
          "// solo existe despues de correr 'Auth > Get CSRF Cookie').",
          "const token = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN');",
          "if (token) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: decodeURIComponent(token) });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "app_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customer_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "order_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get CSRF Cookie",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{app_url}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
              "host": ["{{app_url}}"],
              "path": ["sanctum", "csrf-cookie"]
            },
            "description": "SIEMPRE correr esta request primero (al abrir Postman, o si el login falla con 419). No requiere body ni auth. Deja la cookie XSRF-TOKEN, que el script de la coleccion usa para poner el header X-XSRF-TOKEN en el resto de requests."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Ada Lovelace\",\n    \"email\": \"ada.lovelace@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Publico (pero requiere haber corrido 'Get CSRF Cookie' antes, por el CSRF check). Crea el usuario y ademas inicia sesion (Auth::login) -- Postman guarda la cookie de sesion sola. 422 si el email ya existe o el password tiene menos de 8 caracteres."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Publico (pero requiere haber corrido 'Get CSRF Cookie' antes). Usuario sembrado por UserSeeder. Inicia sesion -- las siguientes requests quedan autenticadas por cookie automaticamente. 401 si las credenciales son incorrectas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa (correr Login antes). Devuelve el usuario autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. Invalida la sesion y regenera el token CSRF (204 sin contenido). Despues de esto hay que correr 'Get CSRF Cookie' de nuevo antes de loguear otra vez."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Products",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products"]
            },
            "description": "Publico. Lista todos los productos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Product",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Publico. 404 si no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Teclado mecanico\",\n    \"sku\": \"KEY-001\",\n    \"description\": \"Switches azules\",\n    \"price\": 59.90,\n    \"cost\": 25.00,\n    \"stock\": 50\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. `sku` debe ser unico. `cost` es opcional."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', pm.response.json().data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Teclado mecanico RGB\",\n    \"sku\": \"KEY-001\",\n    \"description\": \"Switches azules, retroiluminado\",\n    \"price\": 69.90,\n    \"cost\": 28.00,\n    \"stock\": 45,\n    \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. A diferencia de Create, `active` es obligatorio aqui."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Product",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/products/{{product_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["products", "{{product_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. 204 sin contenido."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customers",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Customers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. A diferencia de products, todo /customers esta protegido (datos con PII)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers", "{{customer_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. 404 si no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Juan Perez\",\n    \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+57 300 1234567\",\n    \"address_line_1\": \"Calle 10 #5-30\",\n    \"city\": \"Bogota\",\n    \"state\": \"Cundinamarca\",\n    \"postal_code\": \"110111\",\n    \"country\": \"Colombia\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. Solo `name`, `email` y `country` son obligatorios; el resto es opcional (`user_id` para ligarlo a un usuario registrado)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customer_id', pm.response.json().data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Juan Perez Gomez\",\n    \"email\": \"juan.perez@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+57 300 1234567\",\n    \"address_line_1\": \"Calle 10 #5-30\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellin\",\n    \"state\": \"Antioquia\",\n    \"postal_code\": \"050001\",\n    \"country\": \"Colombia\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers", "{{customer_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Customer",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/customers/{{customer_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers", "{{customer_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. 204 sin contenido."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{order_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. Incluye los `items` anidados con su snapshot (name/sku/price al momento de la compra)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"customer_id\": {{customer_id}},\n    \"items\": [\n        {\n            \"product_id\": {{product_id}},\n            \"quantity\": 2\n        }\n    ],\n    \"discount\": 5,\n    \"currency\": \"USD\",\n    \"notes\": \"Entrega urgente\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["orders"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. `customer_id` y `items` (al menos 1) son obligatorios. Los totales (subtotal/tax/total) se calculan en el servidor, no se envian. Corre 'Create Product' y 'Create Customer' antes para tener product_id/customer_id validos. 422 si algun product_id no existe o no hay stock suficiente."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_id', pm.response.json().data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Order Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"status\": \"confirmed\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["orders", "{{order_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Requiere sesion activa. Valores validos: pending, confirmed, processing, shipped, completed, cancelled. El flujo es secuencial (pending->confirmed->processing->shipped->completed, o pending/confirmed->cancelled). 409 si el salto de estado no es valido (ej. confirmed->shipped)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
